# exp61 artifact hygiene — keep curated source + the curated smoke aggregate trackable,
# ignore build outputs and raw run artifacts. EXPERIMENT-ONLY; builds its own pybind module.

# build / python scratch
build/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.so
*.dylib
*.o
*.a

# raw per-run scratch
_exp61_runs/

# raw logs
*.log
hpx.parcel.*.log
logs/

# Aggregate-write policy (see safe_write_top_aggregate / _finish_scaffold in run_exp61_same_axis.py):
#   TRACKABLE curated PASS aggregates (one per arm):
#     - hpx_smoke_aggregate.json
#     - ray_smoke_aggregate.json
#     - hpx_connected_aggregate.json   (Slice 2B: real two-node PASS only)
#     - ray_remote_aggregate.json      (Slice 2B: real two-node PASS only)
#   IGNORED non-curated siblings. The writer emits "<base>_skip.json", "<base>_fail.json", and
#   "<base>_redirected_<stamp>_<pid>.json" (tag follows "aggregate_" directly), so the patterns
#   must NOT use "aggregate_*_skip" etc. Slice-2A local runs ALWAYS skip, so they only ever produce
#   the ignored "_skip" siblings -- the curated two-node names stay empty until Rostam Slice 2B.
hpx_smoke_aggregate_skip.json
hpx_smoke_aggregate_fail.json
hpx_smoke_aggregate_redirected_*.json
ray_smoke_aggregate_skip.json
ray_smoke_aggregate_fail.json
ray_smoke_aggregate_redirected_*.json
hpx_connected_aggregate_skip.json
hpx_connected_aggregate_fail.json
hpx_connected_aggregate_redirected_*.json
ray_remote_aggregate_skip.json
ray_remote_aggregate_fail.json
ray_remote_aggregate_redirected_*.json

# Slice 3 matched-run artifacts (see _finish_matched / phase_pair_manifest):
#   TRACKABLE: the curated correlation manifest slice3_<id>_manifest.json.
#   IGNORED: the raw pair-scoped per-arm artifacts (reproducible from a matched run).
slice3_*_hpx.json
slice3_*_ray.json

# Slice 5 same-node control artifacts (see _finish_samenode_arm / phase_pair_manifest_samenode /
# phase_band_aggregate_samenode):
#   TRACKABLE: the curated same-node manifest slice5_sn_<id>_manifest.json and the same-node band
#     aggregate slice5_samenode_band_<job>_aggregate.json (NOT matched by the patterns below).
#   IGNORED: the raw pair-scoped per-arm artifacts (reproducible from a matched same-node run).
slice5_sn_*_hpx.json
slice5_sn_*_ray.json
